Subject: [PATCH 454/488] [DS4.1] New requests' draft and confidence rows reset
 in one launch each

The request state zeroed each new request's draft row, and adaptive
verification set its confidences to 1, as the request was added (a
torch fill each). Both are staged and applied with the step's other
staged writes, a TileLang row fill for all of the step's new requests.
